{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1617.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"a0b1d48e5d5ac6bf60da37fc961941df9fad14e50a9b8c50ff8288cec7941b63","ja":"今日の締めは……はい♪　撮影を頑張ったご褒美、\nレモン入りのパウンドケーキよ♪","zh":"今天的收尾是……请用♪ 这是努力拍摄的奖励，\n加了柠檬的磅蛋糕哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1617.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"95a39e96674b54e64a9ea07f710213eb9021aea51c9331cd2c7a9181b8038284","ja":"なんと～。こんなに用意してくれてたんですね～。","zh":"哎呀～。居然准备了这么多呀～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1617.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ffcd57a5ac094172e6a8d45982901e5ca52a00ec7afa576d143f34ed64688605","ja":"レモンは元気が出る最強の果物だからね♪\nさ、これで今日の疲れも全部スッキリ取れるわよ♪","zh":"柠檬可是能让人打起精神的最强水果呢♪\n来，这样一来今天的疲倦就能全部一扫而空啦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1617.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"85a1debcc4e02b46c97322915c7c73e5fb704561656441d5d60c1da6d43697ef","ja":"それは頼もしいですな～。撮影を頑張って\nお腹もペコペコですし、ありがたくいただきますね～。","zh":"那可真是可靠呢～。努力完成了拍摄，\n肚子也饿扁了，我就心怀感激地收下啦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1617.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"ad5706ea3e5bf1dc4ceecadcc6a31b65a7742d4cd5a984807db9767da36293cc","ja":"はは、今日は最後までレモン尽くしだな！\n……うん。甘酸っぱさが疲れた体にしみるよ。","zh":"哈哈，今天从头到尾全都是柠檬呢！\n……嗯。酸甜的味道浸润了疲惫的身体。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1617.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"675a61777324860839db496d477d1b1eb2de5d3606e5ac9236a1fe17ad599ada","ja":"ジュースに、はちみつ漬けに、パウンドケーキ……。\nミキ、一日でこんなにレモン食べたの、初めてかも？","zh":"果汁、蜂蜜渍、磅蛋糕……\n美希在一天之内吃这么多柠檬，可能还是头一次？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1617.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"42733065e09f25bff3d4746a5aaa0a14714196469e66ad2d95f0478864ac32df","ja":"でも、どれも、すっごくおいしかったの☆","zh":"不过，每样都超级好吃的哦☆","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1617.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"2f113247bba5975e86e24d2a4468985651b8694fdc53ae64e3a2cbb888f2560a","ja":"はい～♪　莉緒さんのおかげで、\n楽しく元気に一日を過ごすことができました～。","zh":"好～♪　多亏了莉绪，\n我开开心心、精神饱满地度过了一天～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1617.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"369787f33161147537e225a303ad91aa51a6abdb10a1be7e23d74e1cc24c8908","ja":"レモンのすごさをわかってもらえたし、\n実家のレモンも気に入ってもらえた……。","zh":"既让大家明白了柠檬的厉害之处，\n老家的柠檬也很受喜欢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1617.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"96d85fa0bbc73fff69d8ca878a0915ac4e248a8ef5f45d34a5bb62960fb643ba","ja":"私も大満足だわ！　うふふっ♪","zh":"我也非常满足哦！呵呵♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
